        "label": "fact",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Schwab states its retail business is built to win across generations and is well positioned to continue serving future generations when wealth is passed on, with very high retention around wealth transfers.",
            "quote": "Our retail business is built to win across generations, wealth tiers, investing styles and engagement preferences... we are well positioned to continue serving future generations when that wealth is passed on. Our retention rate around wealth transfers is extremely high, and we are winning assets with all generations.",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "2026-09-30",
            "scope": "Retail business",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "SCHW-TR-2026Q3#11"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Schwab reports that approximately 75% of assets are retained in a wealth transfer event.",
            "quote": "~75%\n\nAssets Retained in a Wealth Transfer Event",
            "value": "~75%",
            "unit": "assets retained in a wealth transfer event",
            "period": "2026-09-30",
            "scope": "Retail",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "SCHW-DECK-2026Q3#24"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Schwab reports that approximately 70% of new-to-firm (NTF) retail households are Gen Z and Millennials.",
            "quote": "~70%\n\nNTF Retail HH are Gen Z & Millennials",
            "value": "~70%",
            "unit": "NTF retail households that are Gen Z & Millennials",
            "period": "2026-09-30",
            "scope": "Retail",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "SCHW-DECK-2026Q3#24"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Schwab states approximately 70% of new-to-firm retail households are Gen Z and millennials, and is well positioned to serve future generations when wealth is passed on.",
            "quote": "We are attracting younger clients, approximately 70% of new-to-firm retail households are Gen Z and millennials.",
            "value": "approximately 70%",
            "unit": "new-to-firm retail households that are Gen Z and millennials",
            "period": "2026-09-30",
            "scope": "Retail",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "SCHW-TR-2026Q3#11"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Schwab states it is enhancing its tax, trust and estate capabilities, including plans to offer wealth.com's estate planning tools to retail clients.",
            "quote": "We are enhancing our tax trust and estate capabilities, including plans to offer wealth.com's estate planning tools to our retail clients.",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "2025-06-30",
            "scope": "Retail",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "SCHW-TR-2025Q2#12"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Schwab took an ownership stake in Wealth.com and began rolling out its estate analysis capability, giving more tools to help clients integrate estate planning into their investment life.",
            "quote": "We took an ownership stake in Wealth.com and began rolling out their estate analysis capability to our specialists, giving us more tools to help clients integrate their estate planning into their investment life.",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "2025-12-31",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "SCHW-TR-2025Q4#6"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Schwab increased its strategic investment in Wealth.com, which it uses to bring AI-powered estate planning tools to clients, and is working to launch AI-powered tax planning capability.",
            "quote": "We also increased our strategic investment in Wealth.com, which we are already using to bring AI-powered estate planning tools to our clients.",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "2026-03-31",
